6048385389998_4765144938683672468_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=WUtR4J0fn94Q7kNvwEnlCLk&_nc_oc=Adorv2QvU0HjpYMZ0IOMKkqbCxbRhIY9Tn6v1XZOait2qdAi39nsP-8cn2TT_mHhgRA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af0z_JvLrKkxsAPT-o2IB6etlu5dSV0vWZ7tqU8RII6M2A&oe=69F0B2D6"}, {"file_name": "offroad_2560_1440.png", "id": "641443405573882", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499310717_641443408907215_1285205295935202012_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=gpC1RjBgkV0Q7kNvwGua3Vc&_nc_oc=AdqpeJWlVw0dvFIgosOKiDm-ZhuZ9qHGuoBRIG-iRxkBzRlOszlNr2INl5lnXv5S9Rg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&oh=00_Af3mQIWr_w4fbYg54EN4Kw1n4jnF7ScQZAc0bMfekN46LQ&oe=69F0B9FB"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "OffRoad Truck Simulator : Driving Game", "keywords": ["offroad", "truckdriving", "simulator", "driver", "driving"], "long_description": "Get ready for the ultimate Off Road challenge in Offroad Truck Simulator! Take control of heavy-duty trucks and explore rugged landscapes filled with steep hills, muddy paths, and dangerous bridges. Experience a realistic driving simulator with truck physics that pushes your driving skills to the limit.\nNavigate tricky terrain, transport valuable cargo, and avoid tipping over in challenging missions. Unlock a variety of powerful trucks, each with unique handling. \nWhether you're a casual player or a simulation enthusiast, this game offers thrilling adventure and immersive gameplay for all skill levels.\nKey Features:\n- Realistic truck physics and controls\n- Challenging offroad environments\n- Exploration missions\n- Multiple trucks to unlock\n\nDo you have what it takes to master the wilderness? Start your engine and find out!\n", "short_description": "Take on the wildest roads in Offroad Truck Simulator! Drive powerful trucks through rugged terrain, muddy tracks, steep hills, and narrow bridges. Deliver cargo safely while mastering extreme 